# Keys of the provider spikes ONLY (T-PLT-39, RN-PLT-04, Q-048, design.md sec. 3.2.2).
#
# Not platform configuration: no Hub setting reads these (C-06, ADR-0003) and no Compose service
# receives them. The real values go in spikes/.env (ignored by git, never committed); here there
# is only the placeholder, the same one context/09 and context/10 use. No value, real or fake.
# Tests: backend/tests/config/test_AC_PLT_06_no_provider_env.py and
# test_AC_PLT_05_env_example_parity.py (these names never appear in the root env.example).

# --- Mercado Pago sandbox (S-001; context/09-cuenta-sandbox-mp-datos-reales.md) ---
MP_PUBLIC_KEY=<ver .env: MP_PUBLIC_KEY>
MP_ACCESS_TOKEN=<ver .env: MP_ACCESS_TOKEN>

# --- Clover sandbox (S-002; context/10-clover-cuenta-sandbox-real.md) ---
CLOVER_APP_SECRET=<ver .env: CLOVER_APP_SECRET>
